+</span>
+<header>
+<h1>
+RUSTSEC-2026-0600
+</h1>
+<span class="subtitle">
+<p>
+<code>openssl-tls</code> trusts OpenSSL's default CA store in addition to the configured cluster CA</p>
+</span>
+</header>
+<dl>
+<dt id="reported">Reported</dt>
+<dd>
+<time datetime="2026-11-24">
+November 24, 2026
+</time>
+</dd>
+<dt id="issued">Issued</dt>
